## Table 4 — The questionnaire utilized in interview

*LaTeX label: `tab:interview_questions`*

| Question ID | Content |
|---|---|
| 1 | How has the core prompt library (e.g., "Quyang Stone Carving Scroll Pattern and Auspicious Wishes") specifically impacted your creative efficiency and cultural understanding during practice sessions? |
| 2 | When using style fusion templates like "Tangshan Shadow Puppetry and Cyberpunk," how do you balance the recognizability of traditional symbols with modern aesthetic innovation? |
| 3 | Does the bilingual annotation feature (e.g., "Jingxing Lacquerware Pattern to Harvest Spiral") enhance your confidence in promoting Hebei culture internationally? Please provide examples. |
| 4 | Compared to traditional tracing based teaching, how does the task chain prompt (e.g., step by step deconstruction of door god patterns) differ in terms of knowledge internalization? |
| 5 | In which application scenarios (education, cultural creativity, cultural tourism, etc.) do you think this tool has the most breakthrough potential? Please elaborate based on your field of expertise. |

